# The Network: iCloud Private Relay
#
# Expects DIRECT. Must precede the iCloud and Apple services classifications, which would otherwise swallow the mask hosts.
#
# Private Relay negotiates its own QUIC transport to the relay edge. On a proxy policy that bootstrap is blocked by the profile's QUIC policy and every attempt burns a retry before TCP fallback; measured at 550 blocked flows in 14 days. DIRECT lets it negotiate for itself. To disable Private Relay at the network instead, point this file at REJECT in the profile.

DOMAIN,mask.icloud.com
DOMAIN,mask-api.icloud.com
DOMAIN,mask-h2.icloud.com
DOMAIN,mask-canary.icloud.com
DOMAIN,doh.dns.apple.com
